```ts
interface MultiLineChartSeries {
  data: ChartDataApiEquity[]; // { timestamp: string; equity: number; pnL?: number }
  color: string; // Stroke color (design uses Category/Accent tokens: accentB700, accentD700, accentF700…)
}
```

## Behavior

### Unified Y-Domain

`computeUnifiedYDomain` (shared with EtLineChart's utils) computes one min/max across every series so all lines use the same yScale. Auto-computed y-axis ticks derive from this unified domain.

### Stroke-Only Rendering

Per the DS multi-line design there is **no area gradient and no left-edge fade mask** — every series is a plain stroke. Secondary series render as static paths beneath the primary; only the primary line plays the draw-in animation.

> Implementation note: dynamically mapped `<Path>` children must NOT be placed inside a Skia `<Mask>` — Skia silently drops/mangles them (verified on simulator). This component avoids masks entirely.

### Cursor

While scrubbing, the vertical needle passes through a dot on **every** series at the cursor x — the primary dot comes from the shared line-chart `Cursor` (gesture-driven `cy`), and each secondary series gets a `SeriesCursorDot` whose `cy` is derived from that series' path via `getYForX`. Dots are tinted with their series color; the primary dot defaults to the primary series color (`cursorColor`). The needle stays neutral (`carbon500`, override via `needleColor`) — tinting it would imply it belongs to one particular series.

Emitted values stay primary-series driven: `selectedValue` and `onCursorDataChange` reflect `series[0]` only. Per-series value emission (multi-value header) is not part of v1.

### Gridlines

One full-width line per y-axis tick, painted beneath all series. Positions come from `computeYAxisTickPositions`, shared with `YAxisLabels`, so gridlines and label chips always align in both distributions. Defaults to the theme-aware `carbonSecondaryDivider` token (Figma `var(--primary-divider)`).

### Reuse

Composes EtLineChart's building blocks instead of duplicating them: `LineChartProvider` + context, `Cursor`, `YAxisLabels`, `useChartGesture`, `useAnimateGraph`, and the pure geometry utils (`computeChartGeometry` with a `yDomain` override).

## Theme Tokens

| Slot            | Token                    |
| --------------- | ------------------------ |
| Gridlines       | `carbonSecondaryDivider` |
| Needle          | `carbon500` (override via `needleColor`) |
| Primary dot     | primary series color (override via `cursorColor`) |
| Scrub overlay   | `backgroundBase`         |
| Series (design) | `accentB700` (purple), `accentD700` (teal), `accentF700` (yellow), `accentG700` (orange) |
